    <!-- Instructions Card -->
    <string name="instructions_title">Client Setup (Laptop / PC)</string>
    <string name="instructions_content">1. Connect this phone to the captive Wi-Fi and complete payment / login.\n2. Turn on Mobile Hotspot (or enable USB Tethering) on this phone.\n3. Connect your laptop to the phone\'s Hotspot or USB.\n4. Start the SOCKS5 Bridge above.\n5. On your laptop, configure SOCKS5 Proxy Host to the phone\'s IP (shown above) and Port 1080.\n\nAll traffic is cleanly bound to the phone\'s authenticated Wi-Fi session via Network.bindSocket() without triggering Radius tethering blocks.</string>
